# =============================================================================
# RemoteRecruit — root (frontend) environment template
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your values. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# The frontend does not need any env vars — the verification link is built
# server-side from FRONTEND_URL (see server/.env). This file exists so you can
# add public Vite variables (VITE_*) if the project ever needs them.
